      sourcePageText: r`B12. In a two-dimensional Hilbert space spanned by the orthonormal basis {|1>,|2>} an operator A acts on the basis vectors as follows: A|1> = 2|1> + i|2> and A|1> = -i|1> + 3|2>. Construct the 2x2 matrix representation of A. Determine whether A is Hermitian. Find the eigenvalues of A. (The second equation is printed with A|1>; it is read as A|2>.)`,
